    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61294" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωμ-ήτης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>villager, countryman</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				762a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				763a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				4.5.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Hec.Fr.</u>
				23
			</span></i> M., <i><span class="en">
				<u>UPZ</u>
				120.3
			</span></i> (-<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίτης</span>, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>),
				<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				4.14
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in a
			city, <i>one of the same quarter</i> or <i>district</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				965
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				488.3
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Philadelphia</span>), <i><span class="en">
