				3695b
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Aesepus</span>): more generally, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Φεραίας κωμῆται χθονός</span>
			<i>dwellers in</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				476
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυρέτρων τῶνδε κωμῆται θεοί</span>
			<i>neighbours</i>, Ion Trag.<i><span class="en">
				37
			</span></i>.</div>
